    - Id: dialogue_28_engine_test
      Title: Engine test / not a launch
      Lines:
      - Speaker: 0
        DisplayName: 
        Text: Sorry. I just tested the engine. I wasn't expecting it to be so powerful. I hope I didn't startle you. I've also adjusted the ship's attitude for flight. Once repairs are complete, you can start it up.
        UseCustomColor: 0
        CustomColor:
          R: 0.65
          G: 1
          B: 0.76
          A: 1
        WaitForContinue: 1
        DelayAfter: 0.5
      - Speaker: 0
        DisplayName: 
        Text: That was only a test. We have not launched. The deadline on the calendar still applies.
        UseCustomColor: 0
        CustomColor:
          R: 0.65
          G: 1
          B: 0.76
          A: 1
        WaitForContinue: 0
        DelayAfter: 0.5
      Choices:
      - Id: dialogue_28_engine_test_option_0
        Label: BACK TO ARCHIVE
        PlayerText: BACK TO ARCHIVE
        DisplayName: 
