    - Id: dialogue_34_another_tomorrow_open
      Title: Is there another route?
      Lines:
      - Speaker: 2
        DisplayName: 
        Text: 'WINDOW CLOSED.

          DEPARTURE AUTHORIZATION DEADLINE EXCEEDED.'
        UseCustomColor: 0
        CustomColor:
          R: 0.65
          G: 1
          B: 0.76
          A: 1
        WaitForContinue: 1
        DelayAfter: 0.5
      - Speaker: 0
        DisplayName: 
        Text: The window has closed. We cannot make this departure.
        UseCustomColor: 0
        CustomColor:
          R: 0.65
          G: 1
          B: 0.76
          A: 1
        WaitForContinue: 0
        DelayAfter: 0.5
      Choices:
      - Id: dialogue_34_another_tomorrow_reply_01
        Label: Is there another route?
        PlayerText: Check again. Is there another route?
        DisplayName: Pioneer-60
        UseCustomColor: 0
        CustomColor:
          R: 0.65
          G: 1
          B: 0.76
          A: 1
        NextNodeId: dialogue_34_another_tomorrow_01
        Conditions: []
        SetFlags: []
        Events: []
      NextNodeId: 
    - Id: dialogue_34_another_tomorrow_01
      Title: Is there another route?
      Lines:
      - Speaker: 0
        DisplayName: 
        Text: I have checked. With the ship in its present condition and the fuel we have left, I cannot give you an alternative route we can safely fly.
        UseCustomColor: 0
        CustomColor:
          R: 0.65
          G: 1
          B: 0.76
          A: 1
        WaitForContinue: 0
        DelayAfter: 0.5
      Choices:
      - Id: dialogue_34_another_tomorrow_reply_02
        Label: Wait for the next one.
        PlayerText: Then we wait for the next one.
        DisplayName: Pioneer-60
        UseCustomColor: 0
        CustomColor:
          R: 0.65
          G: 1
          B: 0.76
          A: 1
        NextNodeId: dialogue_34_another_tomorrow_02
        Conditions: []
        SetFlags: []
        Events: []
      NextNodeId: 
    - Id: dialogue_34_another_tomorrow_02
      Title: Wait for the next one.
      Lines:
      - Speaker: 0
        DisplayName: 
        Text: The next return plan in the archive is in November 1983. That means more than two years of waiting, and the ship would need to be reassessed. Your emergency supplies will not last that long.
        UseCustomColor: 0
        CustomColor:
          R: 0.65
          G: 1
          B: 0.76
          A: 1
        WaitForContinue: 0
        DelayAfter: 0.5
      Choices:
      - Id: dialogue_34_another_tomorrow_reply_03
        Label: Can Earth send someone?
        PlayerText: Can Earth send someone?
        DisplayName: Pioneer-60
        UseCustomColor: 0
        CustomColor:
          R: 0.65
          G: 1
          B: 0.76
          A: 1
        NextNodeId: dialogue_34_another_tomorrow_03
        Conditions: []
        SetFlags: []
        Events: []
      NextNodeId: 
    - Id: dialogue_34_another_tomorrow_03
      Title: Can Earth send someone?
      Lines:
      - Speaker: 0
        DisplayName: 
        Text: We will keep trying to restore contact. But in their last transmission, they said they could not guarantee rescue after the window closed.
        UseCustomColor: 0
        CustomColor:
          R: 0.65
          G: 1
          B: 0.76
          A: 1
        WaitForContinue: 0
        DelayAfter: 0.5
      Choices:
      - Id: dialogue_34_another_tomorrow_reply_04
        Label: What do we do now?
        PlayerText: ...Then what do we do now?
        DisplayName: Pioneer-60
        UseCustomColor: 0
        CustomColor:
          R: 0.65
          G: 1
          B: 0.76
          A: 1
        NextNodeId: dialogue_34_another_tomorrow_04
        Conditions: []
        SetFlags: []
        Events: []
      NextNodeId: 
    - Id: dialogue_34_another_tomorrow_04
      Title: What do we do now?
      Lines:
      - Speaker: 0
        DisplayName: 
        Text: I will explain it in the plainest, most direct terms possible. Your first priority now is to stay alive until we can try to leave again.
        UseCustomColor: 0
        CustomColor:
          R: 0.65
          G: 1
          B: 0.76
          A: 1
        WaitForContinue: 0
        DelayAfter: 0.5
      Choices:
      - Id: dialogue_34_another_tomorrow_reply_05
        Label: Give me the plan.
        PlayerText: That part I understand. Give me the plan.
        DisplayName: Pioneer-60
        UseCustomColor: 0
        CustomColor:
          R: 0.65
          G: 1
          B: 0.76
          A: 1
        NextNodeId: dialogue_34_another_tomorrow_05
        Conditions: []
        SetFlags: []
        Events: []
      NextNodeId: 
    - Id: dialogue_34_another_tomorrow_05
      Title: Give me the plan.
      Lines:
      - Speaker: 0
        DisplayName: 
        Text: First, check the lander's air supply and power. Then restore whatever water recycling equipment we can use in the colony. Until then, we will keep you alive with the facilities that still work.
        UseCustomColor: 0
        CustomColor:
          R: 0.65
          G: 1
          B: 0.76
          A: 1
        WaitForContinue: 1
        DelayAfter: 0.5
      - Speaker: 0
        DisplayName: 
        Text: After that, repair the greenhouse and check the seed reserves. Emergency rations are not enough. We need to start producing food.
        UseCustomColor: 0
        CustomColor:
          R: 0.65
          G: 1
          B: 0.76
          A: 1
        WaitForContinue: 0
        DelayAfter: 0.5
      Choices:
      - Id: dialogue_34_another_tomorrow_reply_06
        Label: From repairs to growing things.
        PlayerText: From repairing a ship to growing things.
        DisplayName: Pioneer-60
        UseCustomColor: 0
        CustomColor:
          R: 0.65
          G: 1
          B: 0.76
          A: 1
        NextNodeId: dialogue_34_another_tomorrow_06
        Conditions: []
        SetFlags: []
        Events: []
      NextNodeId: 
    - Id: dialogue_34_another_tomorrow_06
      Title: From repairs to growing things.
      Lines:
      - Speaker: 0
        DisplayName: 
        Text: The original objective has not been canceled. We just need a different schedule first.
        UseCustomColor: 0
        CustomColor:
          R: 0.65
          G: 1
          B: 0.76
          A: 1
        WaitForContinue: 1
        DelayAfter: 0.5
      - Speaker: 2
        DisplayName: 
        Text: 14 SEP 1981 / SOW
        UseCustomColor: 0
        CustomColor:
          R: 0.65
          G: 1
          B: 0.76
          A: 1
        WaitForContinue: 0
        DelayAfter: 0.5
      Choices:
      - Id: dialogue_34_another_tomorrow_reply_07
        Label: What comes first tomorrow?
        PlayerText: Then tell me what we do first tomorrow.
        DisplayName: Pioneer-60
        UseCustomColor: 0
        CustomColor:
          R: 0.65
          G: 1
          B: 0.76
          A: 1
        NextNodeId: dialogue_34_another_tomorrow_07
        Conditions: []
        SetFlags: []
        Events: []
      NextNodeId: 
    - Id: dialogue_34_another_tomorrow_07
      Title: What comes first tomorrow?
      Lines:
      - Speaker: 0
        DisplayName: 
        Text: Check the greenhouse water supply. If it is usable, prepare to sow.
        UseCustomColor: 0
        CustomColor:
          R: 0.65
          G: 1
          B: 0.76
          A: 1
        WaitForContinue: 1
        DelayAfter: 0.5
      - Speaker: 2
        DisplayName: NARRATION
        Text: Outside, the colony is still empty.
        UseCustomColor: 0
        CustomColor:
          R: 0.65
          G: 1
          B: 0.76
          A: 1
        WaitForContinue: 1
        DelayAfter: 0.5
      - Speaker: 2
        DisplayName: NARRATION
        Text: Tomorrow, you will prepare to plant the first seed.
        UseCustomColor: 0
        CustomColor:
          R: 0.65
          G: 1
          B: 0.76
          A: 1
        WaitForContinue: 0
        DelayAfter: 0.5
      Choices:
      - Id: dialogue_34_another_tomorrow_07_option_0
        Label: BACK TO ARCHIVE
        PlayerText: BACK TO ARCHIVE
        DisplayName: 
        UseCustomColor: 0
        CustomColor:
          R: 0.65
          G: 1
          B: 0.76
          A: 1
        NextNodeId: preview_home
        Conditions: []
        SetFlags: []
        Events: []
      NextNodeId: 
